Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.80,0:01:19.85,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\bord2.3\be5\1vc(&HF5ACA5&,&HF5ACA5&,&HF6C0EA&,&HF6C0EA&)\3c&HFFFFFF&\3a&H0A&}手を伸ばして思い出す
