Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.11,0:01:32.53,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\bord2.3\be5\1vc(&HF5ACA5&,&HF5ACA5&,&HF6C0EA&,&HF6C0EA&)\3c&HFFFFFF&\3a&H0A&}証明しよう　僕ら
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.73,0:01:35.32,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\bord2.3\be5\1vc(&HF5ACA5&,&HF5ACA5&,&HF6C0EA&,&HF6C0EA&)\3c&HFFFFFF&\3a&H0A&}本当はどうしたい？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.61,0:01:37.57,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\bord2.3\be5\1vc(&HF5ACA5&,&HF5ACA5&,&HF6C0EA&,&HF6C0EA&)\3c&HFFFFFF&\3a&H0A&}逃げたいと耳塞いだ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.74,0:01:42.45,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\bord2.3\be5\1vc(&HF5ACA5&,&HF5ACA5&,&HF6C0EA&,&HF6C0EA&)\3c&HFFFFFF&\3a&H0A&}しゃがむ心臓を叩いてった　Swing by
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.91,0:01:48.37,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\bord2.3\be5\1vc(&HF5ACA5&,&HF5ACA5&,&HF6C0EA&,&HF6C0EA&)\3c&HFFFFFF&\3a&H0A&}変わらない表情に　答えを突き立てて
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.04,0:01:52.46,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\bord2.3\be5\1vc(&HF5ACA5&,&HF5ACA5&,&HF6C0EA&,&HF6C0EA&)\3c&HFFFFFF&\3a&H0A&}情熱は月に向かって撃て　スナイパー
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.67,0:01:55.34,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\bord2.3\be5\1vc(&HF5ACA5&,&HF5ACA5&,&HF6C0EA&,&HF6C0EA&)\3c&HFFFFFF&\3a&H0A&}未来はどうやら君次第
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.51,0:01:59.18,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\bord2.3\be5\1vc(&HF5ACA5&,&HF5ACA5&,&HF6C0EA&,&HF6C0EA&)\3c&HFFFFFF&\3a&H0A&}喉が渇いたって後悔はないわ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.34,0:02:04.89,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\bord2.3\be5\1vc(&HF5ACA5&,&HF5ACA5&,&HF6C0EA&,&HF6C0EA&)\3c&HFFFFFF&\3a&H0A&}擦りむいて埋めるの99%　小指には衝動を
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.14,0:02:10.10,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\bord2.3\be5\1vc(&HF5ACA5&,&HF5ACA5&,&HF6C0EA&,&HF6C0EA&)\3c&HFFFFFF&\3a&H0A&}本当はどうしたいんだっけ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.65,0:02:13.32,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\bord2.3\be5\1vc(&HF5ACA5&,&HF5ACA5&,&HF6C0EA&,&HF6C0EA&)\3c&HFFFFFF&\3a&H0A&}合図して　ハートチューンに乗せて
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.32,0:02:16.36,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\bord2.3\be5\1vc(&HF5ACA5&,&HF5ACA5&,&HF6C0EA&,&HF6C0EA&)\3c&HFFFFFF&\3a&H0A&}【Ah,ah Darlin' I know who you are. Ah,Ah】
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.36,0:02:18.45,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\bord2.3\be5\1vc(&HF5ACA5&,&HF5ACA5&,&HF6C0EA&,&HF6C0EA&)\3c&HFFFFFF&\3a&H0A&}一番乗りで　Fly me to the moon
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.45,0:02:21.78,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\bord2.3\be5\1vc(&HF5ACA5&,&HF5ACA5&,&HF6C0EA&,&HF6C0EA&)\3c&HFFFFFF&\3a&H0A&}【Ah,ah Darlin' I know who you are. Ah,Ah】
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.05,0:01:17.18,OPCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\bord2.3\be5\1vc(&HF5ACA5&,&HF5ACA5&,&HF6C0EA&,&HF6C0EA&)\3c&HFFFFFF&\3a&H0A&}只是在远望
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.80,0:01:19.85,OPCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\bord2.3\be5\1vc(&HF5ACA5&,&HF5ACA5&,&HF6C0EA&,&HF6C0EA&)\3c&HFFFFFF&\3a&H0A&}伸出手时才回忆起
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.22,0:01:22.31,OPCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\bord2.3\be5\1vc(&HF5ACA5&,&HF5ACA5&,&HF6C0EA&,&HF6C0EA&)\3c&HFFFFFF&\3a&H0A&}不想被听见的软弱
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.85,0:01:23.98,OPCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\bord2.3\be5\1vc(&HF5ACA5&,&HF5ACA5&,&HF6C0EA&,&HF6C0EA&)\3c&HFFFFFF&\3a&H0A&}想传达给你的声音
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.23,0:01:27.15,OPCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\bord2.3\be5\1vc(&HF5ACA5&,&HF5ACA5&,&HF6C0EA&,&HF6C0EA&)\3c&HFFFFFF&\3a&H0A&}不可能也是种可能
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.35,0:01:29.77,OPCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\bord2.3\be5\1vc(&HF5ACA5&,&HF5ACA5&,&HF6C0EA&,&HF6C0EA&)\3c&HFFFFFF&\3a&H0A&}我一直都知道你是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.11,0:01:32.53,OPCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\bord2.3\be5\1vc(&HF5ACA5&,&HF5ACA5&,&HF6C0EA&,&HF6C0EA&)\3c&HFFFFFF&\3a&H0A&}让我们来证明吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.73,0:01:35.32,OPCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\bord2.3\be5\1vc(&HF5ACA5&,&HF5ACA5&,&HF6C0EA&,&HF6C0EA&)\3c&HFFFFFF&\3a&H0A&}内心究竟想做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.61,0:01:37.57,OPCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\bord2.3\be5\1vc(&HF5ACA5&,&HF5ACA5&,&HF6C0EA&,&HF6C0EA&)\3c&HFFFFFF&\3a&H0A&}想要逃避捂住双耳
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.74,0:01:42.45,OPCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\bord2.3\be5\1vc(&HF5ACA5&,&HF5ACA5&,&HF6C0EA&,&HF6C0EA&)\3c&HFFFFFF&\3a&H0A&}用力拍打蜷缩的心脏 Swing by
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.91,0:01:48.37,OPCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\bord2.3\be5\1vc(&HF5ACA5&,&HF5ACA5&,&HF6C0EA&,&HF6C0EA&)\3c&HFFFFFF&\3a&H0A&}对着那毫无变化的表情 狠狠刺入答案
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.04,0:01:52.46,OPCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\bord2.3\be5\1vc(&HF5ACA5&,&HF5ACA5&,&HF6C0EA&,&HF6C0EA&)\3c&HFFFFFF&\3a&H0A&}将情热瞄准月亮开火吧 狙击手
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.67,0:01:55.34,OPCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\bord2.3\be5\1vc(&HF5ACA5&,&HF5ACA5&,&HF6C0EA&,&HF6C0EA&)\3c&HFFFFFF&\3a&H0A&}未来似乎由你决定
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.51,0:01:59.18,OPCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\bord2.3\be5\1vc(&HF5ACA5&,&HF5ACA5&,&HF6C0EA&,&HF6C0EA&)\3c&HFFFFFF&\3a&H0A&}口渴难耐也绝不后悔
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.34,0:02:04.89,OPCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\bord2.3\be5\1vc(&HF5ACA5&,&HF5ACA5&,&HF6C0EA&,&HF6C0EA&)\3c&HFFFFFF&\3a&H0A&}带着擦伤填满那99% 小拇指勾起冲动
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.14,0:02:10.10,OPCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\bord2.3\be5\1vc(&HF5ACA5&,&HF5ACA5&,&HF6C0EA&,&HF6C0EA&)\3c&HFFFFFF&\3a&H0A&}真正想做的是什么来着
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.65,0:02:13.32,OPCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\bord2.3\be5\1vc(&HF5ACA5&,&HF5ACA5&,&HF6C0EA&,&HF6C0EA&)\3c&HFFFFFF&\3a&H0A&}发出信号吧 搭上心跳的旋律
